# Per-checkout devloop stack env (generated passwords -- never committed).
.devloop-env

# SSH private keys. Never committed, and named here because one was handed over
# by dropping it at the repository root -- which is a perfectly reasonable thing
# for a person to do and a perfectly bad place for the file to sit.
*.pem
*.key
id_rsa
id_ed25519

# 供应商给的原始参考资料：含未打码的密钥样本值，check_secrets 会拒。
# 见 docs/wecom-proxy-message-callback.md「原文有意不入库」。
wecom-proxy-message.md

# 本机才有的输入：**进得来、不进仓**。
#
# 今天住着演示那段视频（`local/demo-assets/product-demo-video.mp4`）——
# 它几十 MB，进了 git 历史就只能改写历史才拿得掉，而 `build_demo_assets.py`
# 开头第一段本来就写着二进制不进仓。
#
# **忽略的是整个目录，不是某个文件名**：一条按文件名写的规则，
# 下一个往同一个地方放东西的人不会知道它存在。
/local/
